{"id":"n70565-3-7","stage":1,"title":"예술 · 艺术","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70565-3-7-1","ko":"가히 예술이다. 정말 놀라워.","zh":"简直就是艺术啊，真是令人惊叹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가히","meaning":"果然，决","explanation":"가히：果然，决","readings":[{"term":"가히","audio":"/audio/87493c9205963c2450c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15017","senseId":"2","lemma":"가히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예술이다.","meaning":"艺术","explanation":"예술：艺术；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예술","audio":"/audio/49e1f872b45e52c125bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70565","senseId":"3","lemma":"예술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀라워.","meaning":"惊人，出奇","explanation":"놀랍다：惊人，出奇；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀랍다","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88324","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀랍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87493c9205963c24","term":"가히","zh":"果然，决","audio":"/audio/87493c9205963c2450c1.mp3","entryId":"15017","definition":"的确真的；或指无论什么情况都绝对地。","pronunciation":["가ː히"]},{"id":"49e1f872b45e52c1","term":"예술","zh":"艺术","audio":"/audio/49e1f872b45e52c125bc.mp3","entryId":"70565","definition":"(喻义)非常漂亮突出的技术。","pronunciation":["예ː술"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"8889c7d331879f69","term":"놀랍다","zh":"惊人，出奇","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3","entryId":"88324","definition":"很好或很壮观，令人深受感动。","pronunciation":["놀ː랍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/aa500659dac6e8999e4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70565-3-7-2","ko":"맞아. 눈물 나는 감동적인 연주였어.","zh":"对啊，那是一场让人感动得想流泪的演奏。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈물","meaning":"眼泪，泪水","explanation":"눈물：眼泪，泪水","readings":[{"term":"눈물","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55290","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"流出（눈물이 나다：流泪）","explanation":"나다：流出（눈물이 나다：流泪）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"18","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감동적인","meaning":"感人的，动人的","explanation":"감동적：感人的，动人的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"감동적","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15451","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연주였어.","meaning":"演奏","explanation":"연주：演奏；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"연주","audio":"/audio/9c951c9c34a78317b25a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14024","senseId":"1","lemma":"연주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"591f11d8b2394fcf","term":"눈물","zh":"眼泪，泪水","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3","entryId":"55290","definition":"从人或动物的眼里流出来的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["눈물"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"流出（눈물이 나다：流泪）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"流出（눈물이 나다：流泪）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"b5ac8c4d76903cbd","term":"감동적","zh":"感人的，动人的","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3","entryId":"15451","definition":"有强烈感受后心动的。","pronunciation":["감ː동적"]},{"id":"9c951c9c34a78317","term":"연주","zh":"演奏","audio":"/audio/9c951c9c34a78317b25a.mp3","entryId":"14024","definition":"使用乐器演奏音乐。","pronunciation":["연ː주"]}],"audio":"/audio/53b4bce0cb20293eb51b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70565","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊，那是一场让人感动得想流泪的演奏。","晚上七点的演出还有票吗？","简直就是艺术啊，真是令人惊叹。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对啊，那是一场让人感动得想流泪的演奏。","简直就是艺术啊，真是令人惊叹。","晚上七点的演出还有票吗？"],"answer":0}]}
